'''''Valeriana montana''''', the '''mountain valerian''',<ref name="RHS_49799" /> is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Caprifoliaceae]].<ref name="POWO_859983-1" /> Native to the mountains of Europe from east-central Spain, southern Italy, [[Alps|the Alps]], the Balkans, and on to the eastern Carpathians,<ref name="POWO_859983-1" /> it is available from commercial suppliers.<ref name="RHS_49799" />

